### Get one normalized public GitHub profile
# @name getGitHubUser
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/github/users/{{username}}
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-profile-user

### Analyze bounded public technology and OSS evidence
# @name analyzeGitHubProfile
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/github/users/{{username}}/profile-analysis
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-profile-analysis

### Repeat profile analysis to observe X-IssueScout-Cache
# @name analyzeGitHubProfileCached
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/github/users/{{username}}/profile-analysis
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-profile-analysis-cache-repeat

### [negative] Reject an invalid GitHub login before upstream I/O
# @name rejectInvalidGitHubUser
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/github/users/invalid--login
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-profile-invalid-login
